WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.970
Pete, hi! Hi, we are here!

2
00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:04.290
Hi, Anna! Hi, Marsha!

3
00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:05.450
Hi!

4
00:00:06.240 --> 00:00:07.510
How are you two?

5
00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:08.670
I am great!

6
00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:14.130
You know, Pete, I am new to D.C. The city is big.

7
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:19.970
Yeah. But you learn a little more every day. How's the new apartment?

8
00:00:19.820 --> 00:00:23.850
The new apartment is great! Let's get coffee!

9
00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:26.970
Anna, do you have a pen?

10
00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:30.130
Yes. I have a pen in my bag.

11
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.970
I have a …

12
00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:45.010
It is not a pen. It is a book. It is a big book.

13
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:49.050
Yes. Yes it is, Pete. I know I have a pen, though…

14
00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:54.460
I have a ....

15
00:01:02.610 --> 00:01:07.930
It is not a pen, Anna ... a toy?

16
00:01:08.360 --> 00:01:09.970
I have a ....

17
00:01:12.220 --> 00:01:15.090
And it is a pillow!

18
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:20.950
Pete, Marsha, I know I have a pen.

19
00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:28.290
Anna, it is a map.

20
00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:33.510
Why do you have a map of the world?

21
00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:38.910
Pete, Marsha. Now I know I have a pen.

22
00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.670
And now you have a lamp.

23
00:01:46.520 --> 00:01:49.550
Anna.

24
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.130
I have a pen! Let’s get coffee!
